#### Notifications

Configure in workflow:

```yaml
# Send notification on failure
- name: Notify on failure
  if: failure()
  run: |
    curl -X POST $WEBHOOK_URL \
      -d "Build failed: ${{ github.event.head_commit.message }}"
```

### Pre-commit Hooks (Husky)

Prevent bad commits from reaching CI:

```json
// package.json
{
  "husky": {
    "hooks": {
      "pre-commit": "lint-staged"
    }
  },
  "lint-staged": {
    "*.js": ["eslint --fix", "git add"],
    "*.dart": ["flutter format", "git add"]
  }
}
```

### Troubleshooting Checklist

When CI fails:

- [ ] Run tests locally first
- [ ] Check all files are committed (especially test files)
- [ ] Verify .gitignore isn't excluding test files
- [ ] Run `flutter analyze` locally
- [ ] Check MongoDB service health
- [ ] Verify environment variables are set
- [ ] Check for async/await issues
- [ ] Verify all imports are correct
- [ ] Check for static vs instance method issues
- [ ] Review recent code changes

