## Summary

**Always**:
- ✅ Test locally before pushing
- ✅ Fix ALL analyzer errors (not just warnings)
- ✅ Use proper environment variables
- ✅ Clean up after tests
- ✅ Write descriptive test names
- ✅ Monitor CI/CD results

**Never**:
- ❌ Commit secrets or tokens
- ❌ Push without running tests
- ❌ Ignore analyzer warnings in CI
- ❌ Skip environment variable setup
- ❌ Use production DB for tests
- ❌ Write flaky tests

**Remember**: CI/CD is your safety net - don't bypass it!
